OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fcontinue to spread across the region
OL,7,Fthis evening, heavy with a risk of
OL,8,Fhail and thunder, before easing from
OL,9,Fthe west overnight. Staying rather
OL,10,Fcloudy, with hill fog across the
OL,11,FPennines. A few showers remain
OL,12,Fpossible by dawn.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FEarly cloud breaking to sunny
OL,15,Fspells. Breezy with scattered showers
OL,16,Faround lunchtime, perhaps heavy.
OL,17,FShowers slowly easing from the west
OL,18,Fduring the afternoon, with winds
OL,19,Ffalling lighter through the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
